{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cr7sBr4cHT1793787919.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法蘭克福乒乓冠軍賽，國家隊王楚欽復出第一戰首圈過關。</p><p></p><p>大師兄歸位了，但身體和手感未完全回來。</p><p></p><p>王楚欽休戰個多月復出，節奏掌握不錯，面對丹麥的連特，「大頭」連贏三局，但三局也差點被搞得頭也大了，首局落後過5-7，搶吧。第二局領先10-8被逼到「刁時」。</p><p></p><p>第三局又要7-9下反勝，這位世界第四球手，贏11-7、14-12及11-9入16強，指站上賽場便帶著必勝信念，一分一分去咬，至於狀態則仍在摸索中。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:39.273457+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:18.523734+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:35.015566+00:00","content_hash":"71266225b8fe8b5122c06370ef537bc6a2c8f6fd81020fa20229ce15f49aa7dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}